                        "active": "B1 IdentityAccess + B2-B10 (9 test categories) = 10",
                        "reserved": "2 (CoreLogic, FreeFunctions) + 4 (library) + 1 (executable Helpers) = 7",
                        "note": "Same total as bare-bone (3 + 14 = 17), library (7 + 10 = 17), executable (3 + 14 = 17). Form transition redistributes sections, not adds them."
